<p id="fs-id1164562233733">What is the focal length of a makeup mirror that produces a magnification of 1.50 when a person’s face is 12.0 cm away? Construct a ray diagram using paper, a pencil and a ruler to confirm your calculation.</p>
<ol id="fs-id1164564941050" type="a">
<li>–36.0 cm</li>
<li>–7.20 cm</li>
<li>7.20 cm</li>
<li>36.0 cm</li>
</ol>
